Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Base MCP plugin catalogue
  lib/security/src/baseMcpPluginCatalogue.generated.ts is generated by
  scripts/refreshBaseMcpPluginCatalogue.mts from the plugin specifications
  Base publishes at https://github.com/base/skills. Only the declarative
  frontmatter of those specs is reproduced — plugin id, title, summary,
  version, chains, tags, risk, auth, shell requirement and the plugin's own
  `requires.allowlist`. Refer to that repository for its licence terms.

Protocol addresses and ABI fragments
  Router, factory, pool and token addresses for Aerodrome, Balancer, Hydrex,
  Uniswap, Moonwell, Morpho, OpenSea and o1.exchange are public on-chain
  facts, pinned here so that no deployment can substitute one silently.
